{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18592","headline":"界围岩水帘 · 柳宗元","name":"界围岩水帘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"界围汇湘曲，青壁环澄流。\n悬泉粲成帘，罗注无时休。\n韵磬叩凝碧，锵锵彻岩幽。\n丹霞冠其巅，想像凌虚游。\n灵境不可状，鬼工谅难求。\n忽如朝玉皇，天冕垂前旒。\n楚臣昔南逐，有意仍丹丘。\n今我始北旋，新诏释缧囚。\n采真诚眷恋，许国无淹留。\n再来寄幽梦，遗贮催行舟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18592.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18592","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}